<title>GERMANY: German December IFO index due Jan 21.</title>
<headline>German December IFO index due Jan 21.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's IFO institute for economic research expects to release its December business climate index on Jan 21, a spokeswoman for the institute said.</p>
<p>November's IFO index for West Germany slipped to 96.9 from a revised 97.3 in October. The index for East Germany rose to 104.8 from a revised 102.5 for October.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom 49 69 756525</p>
